---
# docs/standards/cpp.md: modernize, bugprone, performance, readability. Warnings are errors.
Checks: >
  -*,
  modernize-*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -readability-identifier-length
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '(engine|apps)/(include|src)/.*'
FormatStyle: file
